[I] Terminal based 'The Matrix' like implementation

[T] CMatrix is a curses program that shows text scrolling in and out of the
[T] terminal in the style of the movie The Matrix, with configurable colors
[T] and speed.

[U] https://github.com/abishekvashok/cmatrix

